      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS exceeds analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.91 (up from ₹1.77 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹89.9b (up 35% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹4.94b (up 67% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 5.5% (up from 4.4% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue was in line with analyst estimates. Earnings per share (EPS) surpassed analyst estimates by 9.8%. Revenue is forecast to grow 17% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 18% growth forecast for the Specialty Retail industry in India.",
